  "scope_note": "Client Portal visual surface remains frozen except for explicitly owner-approved scoped exceptions. Owner-approved Deals visual exception remains limited to the authoritative empty state. Market Intelligence is a universal read-only tenant-safe Client projection of published server-authoritative data. On 2026-09-02 the owner required Client Analytics and Client Market News to load when the cabinet opens and thereafter refresh once per hour. The generic 30-second background preload is explicitly prohibited from fetching, caching, owning, or driving Analytics or Market News and remains only for the other Client sections. Market News visualization remains exact Admin canonical DOM/CSS/text parity with the Client-safe endpoint. Analytics visual approval remains limited to inner spacing inside the visible market forecast frame; the correction may re-apply the padding inside same-origin embedded Analytics content, but may not change outer dimensions, position, data, chart, colors, borders, typography, or any other visual surface. On 2026-09-03 the owner explicitly lifted freeze for the Client header correction: the title must be generic 'ЛИЧНЫЙ КАБИНЕТ КЛИЕНТА' with no counterparty suffix, and the upper-row 'Скачать договор PDF' control must be removed. On 2026-09-04 the owner explicitly approved a Home-only delta: remove the entire 'Контур управления' card and redesign 'Быстрые действия' as polished interactive controls while preserving the existing real sidebar navigation targets; no images, photos, business-data or unrelated visual changes are permitted. On 2026-09-04 the owner explicitly approved a 'Мои компании' functional projection correction: preserve the existing drawn zones, replace stale/static company, contract and counters with current server-authoritative context values, hide unsupported stale aliases, and restore the signed-contract PDF download inside the company card; no image generation and no unrelated visual redesign. On 2026-09-04 the owner explicitly approved removal across the Client cabinet of non-interactive text elements positioned on the right side inside primary title frames, while preserving left-side titles, interactive controls, business data and all unrelated visual surfaces. On 2026-09-04 the owner additionally required the corrected Home presentation to be present on the first paint with no 30-second intermediate state; right-side Home metadata and the retired 'Контур управления' card must therefore be suppressed by the head first-paint guard before runtime refresh. On 2026-09-04 the owner explicitly required newly submitted applications to appear in the existing Client Applications section from the current server-authoritative client and contract context. The approved delta is limited to rendering application rows, the registered counter, existing search and status filters, and an interactive application-details disclosure; terminal applications or applications already linked to a deal remain outside the active list. No images, photos, hardcoded business entities or unrelated redesign are permitted. All other Client visual surfaces remain frozen.",
